All Bows under 25 Physical Attack stat can be upgraded via the [[Blacksmith]]. Upgrading does not affect the substats or skills that weapon provides, only the base stats.
==Equippable By==
This category includes some crossbows, which are only equippable by [[Arbalist]]s/[[Shieldshooter]]s. All other bows are equippable by the following classes:
*[[Hunter]]/[[Sniper]]
*[[Arbalist]]/[[Shieldshooter]]
*[[Elven Archer]]
*[[Featherbow]]
*[[Snow Ranger]]
